ext":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_13","text":"I altered Scarlet's armor so that it's thinner around the waist, so that her center of balance is centered more on her legs.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_14","text":"That'll open up her back a bit more, and the extra weight on her legs will only serve to make them stronger.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_15","text":"I still proclaim that thou wasted time on this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_16","text":"I can do my part perfectly well without such revisions.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_17","text":"Fine then, return the armor and we'll put it back the way it was.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_18","text":"... I scarcely believe such extreme measures are necessary.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_19","text":"As for Dorothy,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_20","text":"I made some modifications to your outfit so that it won't get dirty as easily.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_21","text":"Perfect.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_22","text":"Dorothy, my curiosity has been piqued for some time. Why do you place so much emphasis on your posture during a fight?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_23","text":"You obsess over strategy when it's something that could be easily solved by using your own body.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_24","text":"Fighting using your own body seems so barbaric to me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_25","text":"Excuse me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_26","text":"Oh, sorry... what I meant was that I don't think it's very smart.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_27","text":"Come again?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_28","text":"You're just digging yourself into a hole, Dorothy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_29","text":"Can I talk to you for a minute, Dorothy?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_30","text":"Save it for after the operation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_31","text":"Snow White, continue.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_32","text":"I'd rather talk now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_33","text":"... *Sigh*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_34","text":"Anyway, I didn't make any modifications to Lilith's armor or weaponry,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_35","text":"as I can't make heads or tails of her tech in the first place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_36","text":"Hehe, thanks anyway. It's the thought that counts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_37","text":"As for Red Hood,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_38","text":"the wiring of your weapon was in a shambles, so I cleaned it up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_39","text":"There was a lot of gunk built up in the muzzle, and for some reason I can't possibly fathom, there was spaghetti crammed into the magazine.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_40","text":"I can scarcely believe it myself, but there were even a few mushrooms growing on the butt of the rifle.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_41","text":"You're kidding.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_42","text":"Do you want to see?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_43","text":"... No. It's okay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_05_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_05_s_44","text":"Anyway, once I gave it a thorough cleaning, there were no lasting issues.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"